## Security (Non-Negotiable)

- 2FA-ready architecture
- Encrypt sensitive fields at rest
- Rate limiting on auth and money endpoints
- Audit logs for all financial state changes
- PIN confirmation for transfers
- Device tracking
- CSRF (web), Sanctum (API)
- Authorization policies on every resource
- **Idempotency keys** on payment endpoints
- Secure webhook signature validation

---

## Performance

- Redis caching for hot reads
- Queued side effects
- Lazy-loaded UI, paginated lists
- Eager-load Eloquent relations; add DB indexes on foreign keys and query columns

---

## Testing

- Generate tests for **every feature** (Pest)
- Target **90% coverage**
- Test: happy path, authorization denial, validation failure, idempotency, webhook replay, state machine transitions

